<Episode>
<Section type="report" startTime="0" endTime="502.888">
<Turn startTime="0" endTime="6.834" speaker="spk1">
<Sync time="0"/>
*Bueno** pos na:nah ekintsi:n kwali *este** kwali 'te:chtapowi:s ke:ní:w *este** yo:n totopoch nankichi:wah wa:n
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="6.834" endTime="9.971">
<Sync time="6.834"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Xipe:wtewa ke:ní:w ne:n nanko:yah tao:l wa:n nanexketsah
<Who nb="2"/>
Pos
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="9.971" endTime="58.17">
<Sync time="9.971"/>
Pos tinexketsah wa:n tik..., tikwe:cho:tih,
<Sync time="14.434"/>
a:mo kiah..., mah a:mo kaha:wi:ka:n, mah wa:kik tixti.
<Sync time="18.2"/>
Entó:s se:, se: ka:tilia tepitsi:n ika *manteca** ya para kwali se: kichi:wa ya.
<Sync time="24.513"/>
Ke:mah se: ka:tilia ika *manteca**, se: kipa:ta kwaltsi:n wa:n se: kitokia *siquiera** se: *viaje** itech metat
<Sync time="31.435"/>
ke:mah pe:wa ya se: kikohkopi:na, se: ki:xtia ya
<Sync time="36.013"/>
ika n' ohtat ata kahkanaktik, kixi:mah kowtsi:n.
<Sync time="41.013"/>
Entó:s yehwa ya ika se: ki:xtia itech metat, ihkó:n se: kikwi,
<Sync time="45.607"/>
sepa sah se: kitila:nah, entó:s nejó:n ki:sa ya ne:n totopoch
<Sync time="51.513"/>
se: kita:lia itech iswat, se koma:lta:lia ya, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="58.17" endTime="60.919">
<Sync time="58.17"/>
Ton iswayo kikwih.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="60.919" endTime="68.852">
<Sync time="60.919"/>
Se: kikwi pahpataiswat, pahpataiswat oso yo:n nexkoko:kiswat, nochi kwaltia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="68.852" endTime="72.991">
<Sync time="68.852"/>
Ne: wehka:w teh itech ton *tiempo** t'chi:waya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="72.991" endTime="94.096">
<Sync time="72.991"/>
Pos i:pa t'chi:wayah, ke:man tikwa:snekih tikchi:wah wa:n *hasta** a:man neh nikinchi:wilia n' pi:pil.
<Sync time="79.223"/>
Ke:mah, *cuando** n'milia nikchi:was, nikchi:wa, mm,
<Sync time="83.765"/>
nikimpia kowtsitsi:n, ta: nikihtohka ya:lwa nikchi:wati wa:n nikwa:lkwiskia *muestra** pero ka:n niwelik.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="94.096" endTime="99.464">
<Sync time="94.096"/>
Wa:n ne: ke:man ka:ni ne:n kichi:wayah, teh xa: titapale:wia:ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="99.464" endTime="121.128">
<Sync time="99.464"/>
Pos sa nipa kichi:wayah wa:n *hasta** a:man ka:mpa ne:chiliah nite:chi:wili:ti,
<Sync time="105.182"/>
ke:mah ne: ka:mpa *nocomadre** Filomena nikonchi:chi:wa
<Sync time="109.12"/>
wa:n ne: ka:mpa n' yo:n Mi..., yon Virginia Osorio, ke:mah.
<Sync time="116.519"/>
Ka:mpa ne:chiliah neh nikchi:wati, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="121.128" endTime="128.531">
<Sync time="121.128"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Toni se: kita:lilia tixti, i:pa *manteca** sah
<Who nb="2"/>
*Manteca** sah wa:n istatsi:n tepitsi:n, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="128.531" endTime="145.003">
<Sync time="128.531"/>
Ka:sá: neli kikwah ata tsopek, pero kachi *más** kwali ki:sa n' ika *manteca** wa:n istat,
<Sync time="137.534"/>
nejó:n kachi kwali se: ki:xtia, ke:mah, pi:pipiktik ki:sa tixtsi:n, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="145.003" endTime="149.737">
<Sync time="145.003"/>
Wa:n wehka:w ka:ni ne:n kitatekiwtia:yah totopoch.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="149.737" endTime="167.023">
<Sync time="149.737"/>
Pos yehwa ya ke:meh i:n *mahmahyordomohko** wa:n iwtok kichi:wah ka:mpa a:man ata ka:mpa yo:n ne: totio:tsi:n, iwtok kichi:wah.
<Sync time="159.554"/>
Ne: itech *viernes santo, jueves santo** kichi:wah,
<Sync time="163.164"/>
yehwa kite:wa:ntih ata ne: tiopan.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="167.023" endTime="169.58">
<Sync time="167.023"/>
Wa:n wehka:w, a:mo ihwa:k sah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="169.58" endTime="203.825">
<Sync time="169.58"/>
A:..., a:mo, wehka:w a:mo sanipa kichi:wayah, mm, pero
<Sync time="174.803"/>
a:man ompa ne:, ompa ya sah kite:wa:ntih wa:n ika chikola:ato:l, mm,
<Sync time="181.696"/>
chikola:ato:l wa:n ne: wehka:w t'chi:wayah i:n itech i:n *viernes santo**.
<Sync time="190.696"/>
Tikchi:wayah yo:n xokoato:l, tao:l tikpaya:nah
<Sync time="196.306"/>
wa:n se: yowal tikxokoltiah wa:n kwalka:n se: kalaxowa ya, se: kitsetselowa ya, ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="203.825" endTime="209.797">
<Sync time="203.825"/>
Wa:n wehka:w tikihtowa ke a:mo sayoh ka:mpa totio:tsi:n kichi:wayah, ka:ni no: kichi:wayah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="209.797" endTime="221.506">
<Sync time="209.797"/>
Ka:mpa mahmayordomohko, de *santitos** ke:meh i:n kininseliah,
<Sync time="214.033"/>
ompa nokta totopochchi:wah a:man kanah ok, a:mo kanah se: kiita ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="221.506" endTime="224.222">
<Sync time="221.506"/>
Ke:meh katí:n mayo:rdo:mohmeh kichi:wayah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="224.222" endTime="264.049">
<Sync time="224.222"/>
Ne: San Miguelito, tein kiselia ya we:i wa:n *custodio**, San Francisco,
<Sync time="231.756"/>
yo:n yehwa ya i:n tein wetstotikah wa:n ne:n *santísimo**, ne:n *niño dios**
<Sync time="241.366"/>
yehwa yo:n nokta tachi:wayah ika totopoch ka:mpa kiniselia:yah
<Sync time="246.39"/>
pero a:man kanah ok, a:mo kanah se: kita ok.
<Sync time="251.399"/>
Wa:n neli de katka tipi:pil ok, pos aya:mo 'tatsiwiah ok, nochi tia:yah, tik..., ompa ya timomachti:tih ke:ní:w kichi:wah, no: t'chi:wah ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="264.049" endTime="268.003">
<Sync time="264.049"/>
Tehwa:tsi:n a:koni mitsne:xtilih xikchi:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="268.003" endTime="274.081">
<Sync time="268.003"/>
Ne:n no:má:n katka, welia no:, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="274.081" endTime="278.673">
<Sync time="274.081"/>
kwali 'te:chtapowi:s ke:ní:w mo:má:n kichi:waya, itech katí:n *tiempo** yeh kichi:waya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="278.673" endTime="307.167">
<Sync time="278.673"/>
Pos *cuando** neh nipili katka, ki:xeheko ka:nachi a, ka:nachi xiwit nikpia ya
<Sync time="285.462"/>
*cuando neh ni:xpeta:n kichi:waya.
<Sync time="288.978"/>
Te:chmaka pero pos neh aya:mo, aya:mo tikchi:wayah, a:mo niwelia,
<Sync time="294.083"/>
ke:mah, yeh kichi:waya wa:n te:chmahmaka mah tikwa:ka:n ya.
<Sync time="298.86"/>
Entó:s de nikitak ke:ní:w kichi:wa no: pe:wak nikchi:wa, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="307.167" endTime="316.907">
<Sync time="307.167"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Yeh a:mo tapale:wia:ya ke:meh yo:n *mayordomohko** kichi:wayah.              
<Who nb="2"/>
Ke:mah no: tapale:wia:ya, no: tapale:wia:ya, no: ya:ya.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="316.907" endTime="322.133">
<Sync time="316.907"/>
kwali 'te:chtapowi:s itech katí:n *mayordomos** kinpale:wih.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="322.133" endTime="342.962">
<Sync time="322.133"/>
Pos ke:meh San Miguelito ompaka wel ya:ya San Miguelito ne:wí:n kowtahpa,
<Sync time="327.781"/>
ke:mah, yehwa ya yo:n *santísimo** niñohtsi:n wa:n tehwa:n no: miakpa kiniselia:yah yehwa:n
<Sync time="334.716"/>
kinimakayah todiostsitsi:n, miakpa mayo:rdo:mohtikeh de wehwei *santitos**, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="342.962" endTime="347.57">
<Sync time="342.962"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Wa:n ihwa:k nochi totopoch nante:wa:ntiah.   
<Who nb="2"/>
Nochi yehwa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="347.57" endTime="361.626">
<Sync time="347.57"/>
Nochi yehwa te:wa:ntiah, totopoch wa:n ato:l, chikola:ato:l,
<Sync time="352.241"/>
'chi:wayah ika *ca..., caso** a:mo ika ko:mit.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="361.626" endTime="373.049">
<Sync time="361.626"/>
Wa:n ekintsi:n tehwa:tsi:n ke:yeh tiki:xehekowa ika pos a:mo kichi:wa ok wa:n a:mo mote:wa:nti ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="373.049" endTime="386.516">
<Sync time="373.049"/>
A:it ke:yeh tak ka:n kinekih ok kichi:waskeh, ox a:mo welih ok, a:it ke:ní:w,
<Sync time="378.5"/>
miakeh, ne: ke:man miak weliah na:nahmeh, seki nemih ok tein welih.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="386.516" endTime="391.674">
<Sync time="386.516"/>
Tehwa:tsi:n, a:man pi:pil a:mo tikine:xtilia mah kichi:waka:n.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="391.674" endTime="417.513">
<Sync time="391.674"/>
Nikine:xtilia pero a:mo welih, mm,
<Sync time="394.606"/>
ka:n welih, kichi:wasnekih pero ka:n welih, nochi a:mo welih nopi:pilwa:n, mm.
<Sync time="400.608"/>
*Solo** weli se:, ompa se: noxwiw se:sah, ke:mah, weli kichi:wa, 'kohpi:na no: wehwei totopoch,
<Sync time="413.212"/>
pero nopi:pilwa:n nió:n se: a:mo weli.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="417.513" endTime="429.22">
<Sync time="417.513"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Wa:n moxwi:w no: tehwa tikne:xtilih.          
<Who nb="2"/>
No: nehwa n'ne:xtilih pero ke:meh kitak ke:..., niki:xtia no: iwki kichi:wa, entó:s kwaltsi:n ki:sa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="429.22" endTime="433.469">
<Sync time="429.22"/>
Xa: teisá: *más** ok tikelna:miktos de i:n totopoch.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="433.469" endTime="462.939">
<Sync time="433.469"/>
Yehwa sah, yo:n name:chilih ika ohtat tiki:xtiah, mm,
<Sync time="440.26"/>
no: kwali se: kichi:wa ika *panela o** ika *azúcar**
<Sync time="444.836"/>
pero a:mo kachi ki:sa, a:mo, a:mo kwaltia se: kihki:xtia
<Sync time="449.684"/>
nejó:n kokotoka wa:n ika *manteca** wa:n ika ne:n ika tepitsi:n se: kita:lilia istat *más** kwali ki:sa, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="462.939" endTime="470.598">
<Sync time="462.939"/>
*Bueno** pos komohkó:n a:mo teh tikelna:miki ok de n' totopoch, kwali 'te:chili:s moto:kay.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="470.598" endTime="474.916">
<Sync time="470.598"/>
Mm. Eugenia Samitez Lucas.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="474.916" endTime="476.523">
<Sync time="474.916"/>
Ka:nachi xiwit tikpia.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="476.523" endTime="479.429">
<Sync time="476.523"/>
Ke:meh name:chilwih.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="479.429" endTime="482.578">
<Sync time="479.429"/>
Wa:n katí:n xola:l tiwa:le:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2 spk1" startTime="482.578" endTime="489.92">
<Sync time="482.578"/>
<Who nb="1"/>
Sempowal, sempowal wa:n mahtaktiome:i, ke:mah.
<Who nb="2"/>
Katí:n xola:l tiwa:le:wa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="489.92" endTime="496.508">
<Sync time="489.92"/>
Sa:n Miguel Tzinacapan pero nimoskaltih ompa ne: seko, kowtah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="496.508" endTime="502.888">
